      <div class="legend-item"><span class="partial">&#9681;</span> Partial / limited</div>
      <div class="legend-item"><span class="no">&#10007;</span> Not supported</div>
      <div class="legend-item"><span class="planned">&#8224;</span> Planned (Phase 2)</div>
      <div class="legend-item"><span class="unknown">?</span> Not yet evaluated</div>
