        updating, or deleting a DIRECTORY isn't supported by the app yet (the Request Inspector only shows HTTP traffic &mdash; it doesn't send
        requests), so that still requires an external REST client. CONTRIBUTION can be viewed by UID &mdash; entered directly, or reached from a
        composition's Versions tab &mdash; but the openEHR REST API has no endpoint to list all contributions for an EHR, so there's no browsable
